### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  BloodLink 2.0 — REST API Test Collection
###  Use with VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl    = http://localhost:5000
@donorEmail = zeeshansajid361@gmail.com
@password   = Password123!

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###  AUTH
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [AUTH-01] Register as donor (includes donor-specific fields)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":             "Zeeshan Sajid",
  "email":            "{{donorEmail}}",
  "password":         "{{password}}",
  "role":             "donor",
  "phone":            "03001234567",
  "city":             "Rawalpindi",
  "age":              22,
  "gender":           "male",
  "bloodGroup":       "O+",
  "lastDonationDate": null
}

###

### [AUTH-02] Register as seeker
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":     "Test Seeker",
  "email":    "seeker@test.com",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "role":     "seeker",
  "phone":    "03111234567",
  "city":     "Islamabad"
}

###

### [AUTH-03] Login — copy accessToken and refreshToken from response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email":    "{{donorEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###

### [AUTH-04] Refresh access token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

###

### [AUTH-05] Resend verification email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{donorEmail}}"
}

###

### [AUTH-06] Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###  DONOR MODULE  (set @token after login above)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### [DONOR-01] Get own profile + eligibility + recognition level
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/donors/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [DONOR-02] Update donor profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/donors/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":        "Zeeshan Sajid (updated)",
  "city":        "Islamabad",
  "age":         23,
  "bloodGroup":  "O+",
  "bio":         "Happy to donate whenever needed."
}

###

### [DONOR-03] Mark as unavailable
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/donors/me/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isAvailable": false
}

###

### [DONOR-04] Mark as available again
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/donors/me/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isAvailable": true
}

###

### [DONOR-05] Search donors — blood group only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/donors/search?bloodGroup=O%2B
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [DONOR-06] Search donors — blood group + city
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/donors/search?bloodGroup=O%2B&city=Rawalpindi
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###  SEEKER MODULE  (set @seekerToken after seeker login)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@seekerToken = PASTE_SEEKER_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### [SEEKER-01] Search compatible donors — O+ patient, all cities (public endpoint)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/seekers/search?patientBloodGroup=O%2B

###

### [SEEKER-02] Search compatible donors — AB+ patient, Islamabad
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/seekers/search?patientBloodGroup=AB%2B&city=Islamabad

###

### [SEEKER-03] Compatibility info for a blood group
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/seekers/compatibility?bloodGroup=B%2B

###

### [SEEKER-04] Submit blood request (multipart — use a REST client that supports files)
# In VS Code REST Client, file uploads require the multipart/form-data syntax below.
# Replace the file path with a real image path on your machine.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/seekers/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{seekerToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=BloodLinkBoundary

--BloodLinkBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="patientBloodGroup"

O+
--BloodLinkBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="hospitalName"

PIMS Hospital
--BloodLinkBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="hospitalCity"

Islamabad
--BloodLinkBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="unitsNeeded"

2
--BloodLinkBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="urgency"

urgent
--BloodLinkBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="patientName"

Ahmed Khan
--BloodLinkBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document"; filename="slip.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-files/sample-slip.jpg
--BloodLinkBoundary--

###

### [SEEKER-05] Get own requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/seekers/requests/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{seekerToken}}

###

### [SEEKER-06] Cancel a pending request (replace REQUEST_ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/seekers/requests/REQUEST_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{seekerToken}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###  HOSPITAL MODULE  (set @hospitalToken after hospital login)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@hospitalToken = PASTE_HOSPITAL_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@hospitalApiKey = PASTE_HOSPITAL_API_KEY_HERE

### [HOSPITAL-01] Register hospital account (auth step — use AUTH-02 template)
# Register with role: hospital, then login to get hospitalToken

###

### [HOSPITAL-02] Register organisation profile
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hospitals/register
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":     "PIMS Hospital",
  "type":     "hospital",
  "city":     "Islamabad",
  "street":   "G-8/3, Islamabad",
  "province": "ICT",
  "phone":    "051-9261170",
  "email":    "blood@pims.gov.pk"
}

###

### [HOSPITAL-03] Get own org profile + inventory
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hospitals/me
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}

###

### [HOSPITAL-04] Update org profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/hospitals/me
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "051-9261172",
  "street": "G-8/3 Mauve Area, Islamabad"
}

###

### [HOSPITAL-05] Public directory — all approved hospitals
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hospitals/directory

###

### [HOSPITAL-06] Public directory — filtered by city
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hospitals/directory?city=Islamabad&type=hospital

###

### [HOSPITAL-07] Add blood group stock (requires approved status)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hospitals/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bloodGroup":        "O+",
  "units":             15,
  "expiresAt":         "2026-09-30",
  "lowStockThreshold": 3
}

###

### [HOSPITAL-08] Add another blood group
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hospitals/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bloodGroup":        "B-",
  "units":             2,
  "lowStockThreshold": 3
}

###

### [HOSPITAL-09] Update inventory entry (replace INVENTORY_ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/hospitals/inventory/INVENTORY_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "units": 20,
  "lowStockThreshold": 4
}

###

### [HOSPITAL-10] Delete inventory entry (replace INVENTORY_ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/hospitals/inventory/INVENTORY_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}

###

### [HOSPITAL-11] Issue Code Red broadcast (replace INVENTORY_ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hospitals/broadcast
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": "INVENTORY_ID_HERE",
  "message":     "Critical shortage of B- blood at PIMS. Donors please report immediately."
}

###

### [HOSPITAL-12] Cancel Code Red (replace INVENTORY_ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/hospitals/broadcast/INVENTORY_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}

###

### [HOSPITAL-13] Machine sync via API key (demo — replace key after admin issues it)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hospitals/inventory/sync
Authorization: ApiKey {{hospitalApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "updates": [
    { "bloodGroup": "A+",  "units": 8,  "expiresAt": "2026-10-15" },
    { "bloodGroup": "AB-", "units": 1 },
    { "bloodGroup": "O-",  "units": 5,  "expiresAt": "2026-10-01" }
  ]
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###  HEALTH
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [HEALTH] API health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

